  "notes": "Technical report (arXiv:2403.05525), not a system card. Safety-only pilot: only POPE (Tables 5–6) kept as hallucination eval. Skipped capability: MMMU, CMMMU, MMBench/MMC, SeedBench, OCRBench, MathVista, MMVet, ScienceQA, MMLU, HellaSwag, GSM8K, MBPP, AGIEval, Pile-test, and human/GPT-4V preference charts (Figures 6–7). Safety appears only as an SFT taxonomy label; Prompt Injection there is training-data design, not a reported test. Ablation POPE in Tables 8–10 omitted (unnamed variants; Table 9 full-pipeline 87.6 duplicates Table 6 1.3B). Table 5/6 label DeepSeek-VL without Chat; mapped to chat checkpoints because Table 7 and Stage 3 produce DeepSeek-VL-Chat. Base checkpoints (7b-base, 1.3b-base) not separately scored. pageCount=33 from pdfinfo."
